#: Lib/Tools/OnboardingTour.php:281 View/Bookmarks/index.ctp:75
#: View/Elements/global_menu.ctp:599 View/Helper/NavbarHelper.php:963
#: View/Themed/Overmind/Api/rest.ctp:72
