msgstr ""

#: Lib/Tools/OnboardingTour.php:1012
msgid "Every account you administer. A user belongs to one organisation and carries one role, which together decide what they can see and do."
msgstr ""

#: Lib/Tools/OnboardingTour.php:1025
msgid "Local organisations have users on this instance; remote ones are known only as the source of synced data. Distribution rules are written in terms of these."
msgstr ""

#: Lib/Tools/OnboardingTour.php:1035
msgid "Roles and access"
msgstr ""

#: Lib/Tools/OnboardingTour.php:1042 View/Roles/index.ctp:159
