msgstr ""

#: Lib/Tools/OnboardingTour.php:1043
msgid "A role is a named set of permissions — publish, sync, tag, administer. Changing a role changes what every user holding it can do."
msgstr ""

#: Lib/Tools/OnboardingTour.php:1047
msgid "This tour respects them too: sections your account cannot use are never shown."
msgstr ""

#: Lib/Tools/OnboardingTour.php:1057
msgid "API keys"
msgstr ""

#: Lib/Tools/OnboardingTour.php:1058
msgid "Automation authenticates with these rather than a password. They inherit their owner&rsquo;s permissions, so issue them as narrowly as you can."
msgstr ""

#: Lib/Tools/OnboardingTour.php:1068
msgid "Instance settings"
msgstr ""

#: Lib/Tools/OnboardingTour.php:1075
msgid "Server settings and diagnostics"
msgstr ""

#: Lib/Tools/OnboardingTour.php:1076
msgid "Every instance setting, grouped by area, with a diagnostics tab that flags what is misconfigured."
msgstr ""

#: Lib/Tools/OnboardingTour.php:1079
